Package: cauda
Title: Causal Automated Unified Data Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Aadi", "Soni", , "mr.aadi.soni@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Two independent toolkits for causal analysis. The first
    extracts causal claims from academic papers with source-quotation
    provenance, assembles them into directed acyclic graphs, critiques
    each claim's evidentiary strength, derives each graph's testable
    conditional-independence implications via dagitty, and tests those
    implications against a real dataset. The second learns a causal DAG
    directly from a tabular data frame, alongside correlation networks,
    partial dependence plots, and decision optimization.
